flowchart TB
  C["<b>Client</b>"]
  API["<b>API</b><br/><i>POST /orders</i>"]
  CMD[("<b>Jobs</b><br/><i>PENDING, then DONE or FAILED</i>")]
  W["<b>Worker</b><br/><i>claim & create order</i>"]
  STATUS["<b>Status endpoint</b><br/><i>GET /jobs/{jobId}</i>"]

  C -->|1. POST /orders| API
  API -->|persist, PENDING| CMD
  API -.->|2. 202 Accepted, jobId| C
  CMD -->|3. claim_next| W
  W -.->|4. mark DONE, retry, or FAILED| CMD
  C -->|5. poll| STATUS
  STATUS -->|reads| CMD
  STATUS -.->|6. 302 Found, Order url| C

  classDef store fill:#e8eef7,stroke:#3d5a80,stroke-width:2px
  classDef comp fill:#eef0fb,stroke:#5b5ea6,stroke-width:2px
  classDef write fill:#fde8e8,stroke:#a33,stroke-width:2px
  classDef read fill:#e8f7ec,stroke:#2d6a4f,stroke-width:2px
  class CMD store
  class C,W comp
  class API write
  class STATUS read
